rified. A player comment about northern Riverglades is attributed,not verified coordinates.\nPublished guide approach: find the Krol'dok Stronghold portal north of Sunnyglade in Riverglades, east of the closed city approach. Horde: approach from Rog'mar if its flight point is known, otherwise from the Badlands. Alliance: travel north from Farholde Keep if its flight point is known, otherwise approach from Redridge. These are written regional directions; exact entrance coordinates, current access and in-instance floors remain unverified.",["kind"]="dungeon",["verification"]="published-reference"},["Molten Core"]={["areaID"]=2717,["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8cd_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="d08a56b77abe277d94c99faefb0624b7e7cd729197789edd6a931ee810ac9a21",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/zone=2717"},["instructions"]="Published transport reference: Lothos Riftwaker in Blackrock Mountain (Burning Steppes area26.4–26.6,24.4–24.8). Attunement to the Core #7848,minimum55/Both,asks one Core Fragment from the Molten Core entry portal inside Blackrock Depths;return to Lothos. Current mandatory entry,other access paths and earlier unlocks unverified. Map action resolves the client instance entrance,not Lothos or a boss floor point.",["kind"]="raid",["verification"]="published-reference"},["Naxxramas"]={["areaID"]=3456,["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8cd_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="cacb85934882def5260f8f40071f6b828e0a4c72442ccd3427aecba408399657",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/zone=3456"},["instructions"]="Published Naxxramas access reference: visit Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel,Eastern Plaguelands81.4–81.6,58.2. The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas alternatives,minimum60/Both: Honored9121 asks5 Arcane Crystals,2 Nexus Crystals,1 Righteous Orb and60gold;Revered9122 asks2 Arcane Crystals,1 Nexus Crystal and30gold;Exalted9123 waives the cost. Choose the reputation alternative,not all three quests. Published completion describes the rune portal in Plaguewood. Current mandatory attunement,acceptance,phase/access and your completion state are unverified;giver fullpage remains unread. Map action resolves a client entrance,not an invented portal or boss floor point.",["kind"]="raid",["verification"]="published-reference"},["Scholomance"]={["areaID"]=2057,["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8cd_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="b11cccea9d937bcd08f9742d691d6ea406528c095f8c462768ff13d90c78b4fc",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/zone=2057"},["instructions"]=nil,["kind"]="dungeon",["verification"]="published-reference"},["Stratholme"]={["areaID"]=2017,["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8cd_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="efa48e7eb44031004eb9fbcbcff21ef05bcc62902d4474638af391d5de335385",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/zone=2017"},["instructions"]=nil,["kind"]="dungeon",["verification"]="published-reference"},["Zul'Gurub"]={["areaID"]=1977,["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8cd_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="85192b7b35711657bf6744260ed1b18944921412ba301890546dd8b40a2d01fa",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/zone=1977"},["instructions"]="Published instance source. Open the client-resolved entrance if available;exact boss floor/wing,keys,current access and group requirements remain unverified. No invented floor coordinate.",["kind"]="raid",["verification"]="published-reference"}},["instances"]={["Ahn'Qiraj"]=true,["Alcaz Prison"]=true,["Blackfathom Deeps"]=true,["Blackmaw Hold"]=true,["Blackrock Depths"]=true,["Blackrock Spire"]=true,["Blackwing Lair"]=true,["City of Dalaran"]=true,["Deadmines"]=true,["Dire Maul"]=true,["Excavation Site: Wetlands"]=true,["Gnomeregan"]=true,["Krol'dok Stronghold"]=true,["Maraudon"]=true,["Molten Core"]=true,["Naxxramas"]=true,["Ragefire Chasm"]=true,["Razorfen Downs"]=true,["Razorfen Kraul"]=true,["Ruins of Lordaeron"]=true,["Scarlet Monastery"]=true,["Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard"]=true,["Scholomance"]=true,["Shadowfang Keep"]=true,["Stormwind Sto