ID"]=8855,["verification"]="published-reference"},{["containerItemID"]=11883,["instructions"]="The Good Stuff #4286: Alliance quest minimum 50. Start and return to Oralius in Burning Steppes; collect 20 Dark Iron Fanny Packs #11468 in Blackrock Depths for one Dingy Fanny Pack #11883. Equipment is a possible random content, not guaranteed. Earlier unlocks, current access/repeatability, mixed input-farm map references and random rolls remain unverified. These are source gates, not the gear's equip or wearer requirements.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=4286,["verification"]="published-reference"},{["containerItemID"]=15902,["instructions"]="Augustus the Touched in Terrordale sells A Crazy Grab Bag #15902, not guaranteed equipment. First complete Augustus' Receipt Book #6164 (minimum 50, Both factions): accept from Augustus, recover one book #15884 at the published inn/object #177789 area (17.4–17.5,31.2), then return. Vendor area is 14.4–14.6,33.4–33.6 in Eastern Plaguelands. Published stock is one; offer is 7g20s while the item base buy value is 8g. Current charged price, stock, restock timing and unlock interaction are unverified. Bag BoP/plain Unique and quest minimum do not change the gear's own eligibility. Random contents are not guaranteed.",["kind"]="vendor_container",["offer"]={["avail"]=1,["cost"]={{72000,{},{}}},["publishedStanding"]=0},["source"]="npc:12384",["verification"]="published-reference"}}},["10096"]={["category"]="world_drop",["itemID"]=10096,["routes"]={{["containerItemID"]=11883,["instructions"]="The Good Stuff: Alliance, minimum quest level 50. Visit Oralius in Burning Steppes, collect 20 Dark Iron Fanny Packs in Blackrock Depths and return for one Dingy Fanny Pack. This equipment is a possible random content, not a guaranteed reward. Earlier unlocks, current quest access, repeatability and input farming locations remain unverified. These are quest requirements; the equipment requires level 49.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=4