 alternative deliveries,not combined fees or required Colossus kills. Current event phase, researcher presence, earlier unlocks, bag opening and rolls unverified. Random equipment,not guaranteed reward. Full wrapper contents are Classic-labelled possible contents; current Forever contents are not confirmed.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=8858,["verification"]="published-reference"},{["containerItemID"]=21528,["instructions"]="Start with Colossus Researcher Sophia #15797 in Silithus. The quest provides one Colossus of Zora's Husk #21533;deliver it to Lord Maxwell Tyrosus #11034. Published minimum51/Both;three alternative deliveries,not combined fees or required Colossus kills. Current event phase, researcher presence, earlier unlocks, bag opening and rolls unverified. Random equipment,not guaranteed reward. Full wrapper contents are Classic-labelled possible contents; current Forever contents are not confirmed.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=8859,["verification"]="published-reference"},{["containerItemID"]=20601,["instructions"]="Published quest Signet of the Dukes #8348 gives one Sack of Spoils #20601 for one Abyssal Signet #20514; equipment is a possible random content. Both factions/minimum 60. Start the published itinerary with Huum Wildmane in Cenarion Hold, Silithus:8331→8332→8349→8348. Aurel makes the medallion for one Large Brilliant Shard and three Abyssal Crests; wear it with Twilight Trappings to use a wind stone as published. Bor Wildmane takes the signet. Exact earlier prerequisites, reputation thresholds, current summoning/access and repeat unlocks remain unverified; no mandatory graph or current guaranteed Duke loot is claimed.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=8348,["verification"]="published-reference"},{["containerItemID"]=20601,["instructions"]="Published Abyssal Signets #8363 gives one Sack of Spoils #20601 for three Abyssal Signets #20514 at Bor Wildmane, Cenarion Hold, Silithus (Both factions/minimum 60). This is a distinct exchange, not an extra three-signets fee for #8348. Current initial/repeat unlocks, acceptance and random rolls are unverified. See the initial #8348 published itinerary for first-contact guidance; the exact prerequisite relationship to this exchange is unresolved.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=8363,["verification"]="published-reference"}}},["246055"]={["category"]="vendor",["itemID"]=246055,["routes"]={{["instructions"]="Published stock: -1; Published costDescription: 1 unnamed required item #239730; Published playerConditions: []\nPublished stock: -1; Published costDescription: 1 Inquisition Gloves #240028; Published playerConditions: []\nPublished stock: -1; Published costDescription: 1 Inquisition Handguards #240041; Published playerConditions: []",["kind"]="vendor",["source"]="npc:11036",["verification"]="published-reference"},{["instructions"]="Published stock: -1; Published costDescription: 1 unnamed required item #239117 + 1 unnamed required item #238292; Published playerConditions: []",["kind"]="vendor",["source"]="npc:240248",["verification"]="published-reference"}}},["246056"]={["category"]="vendor",["itemID"]=246056,["routes"]={{["instructions"]="Published stock: -1; Published costDescription: 1 unnamed required item #239722; Published playerConditions: []\nPublished stock: -1; Published costDescription: 1 Inquisition Vambraces #240023; Published playerConditions: []\nPublished stock: -1; Published costDescription: 1 Inquisition Wristguards #240042; Published playerConditions: []",["kind"]="vendor",["source"]="npc:11036",["verification"]="published-reference"},{["instructions"]="Published stock: -1; Published costDescription: 1 unnamed required item #239117 + 1 unnamed required item #238291; Published playerConditions: []",["kind"]="vendor",["source"]="npc:240248",["verification"]="published-reference"}}},["246057"]={["category"]="vendor",["itemID"]=246057,["routes"]={{["instructions"]="Published stock: -1; Published costDescription: 1 unnam