orever contents are not confirmed.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=8857,["verification"]="published-reference"},{["containerItemID"]=21528,["instructions"]="Start with Colossus Researcher Eazel #15799 in Silithus. The quest provides one Colossus of Regal's Husk #21535;deliver it to Overseer Oilfist #14625. Published minimum51/Both;three alternative deliveries,not combined fees or required Colossus kills. Current event phase, researcher presence, earlier unlocks, bag opening and rolls unverified. Random equipment,not guaranteed reward. Full wrapper contents are Classic-labelled possible contents; current Forever contents are not confirmed.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=8858,["verification"]="published-reference"},{["containerItemID"]=21528,["instructions"]="Start with Colossus Researcher Sophia #15797 in Silithus. The quest provides one Colossus of Zora's Husk #21533;deliver it to Lord Maxwell Tyrosus #11034. Published minimum51/Both;three alternative deliveries,not combined fees or required Colossus kills. Current event phase, researcher presence, earlier unlocks, bag opening and rolls unverified. Random equipment,not guaranteed reward. Full wrapper contents are Classic-labelled possible contents; current Forever contents are not confirmed.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=8859,["verification"]="published-reference"}}},["5267"]={["category"]="world_drop",["itemID"]=5267,["routes"]={{["containerItemID"]=20601,["instructions"]="Published quest Signet of the Dukes #8348 gives one Sack of Spoils #20601 for one Abyssal Signet #20514; equipment is a possible random content. Both factions/minimum 60. Start the published itinerary with Huum Wildmane in Cenarion Hold, Silithus:8331→8332→8349→8348. Aurel makes the medallion for one Large Brilliant Shard and three Abyssal Crests; wear it with Twilight Trappings to use a wind stone as published. Bor Wildmane takes the signet. Exact earlier prerequisites, reputation thresholds, current summoning/access and repeat unlocks remain unverified; no mandatory graph or current guaranteed Duke loot is claimed.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=8348,["verification"]="published-reference"},{["containerItemID"]=20601,["instructions"]="Published Abyssal Signets #8363 gives one Sack of Spoils #20601 for three Abyssal Signets #20514 at Bor Wildmane, Cenarion Hold, Silithus (Both factions/minimum 60). This is a distinct exchange, not an extra three-signets fee for #8348. Current initial/repeat unlocks, acceptance and random rolls are unverified. See the initial #8348 published itinerary for first-contact guidance; the exact prerequisite relationship to this exchange is unresolved.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=8363,["verification"]="published-reference"},{["containerItemID"]=20602,["instructions"]="Published Scepter of the Council #8352: minimum 60, Both factions. Start the published initial itinerary with Huum Wildmane in Cenarion Hold, Silithus:8343→8341→8351→8352. Aurel exchanges five Large Brilliant Shards and three Abyssal Signets for Ring of Lordship20451. Published Greater Wind Stone instructions use ring, Medallion of Station and Twilight Trappings together. Bor takes one Abyssal Scepter20515 for one Chest of Spoils20602; this equipment is a possible random content. Exact earlier prerequisites, reputation, current group/summoning/phase/access and initial-repeat conditions remain unverified.",["kind"]="quest_container",["questID"]=8352,["verification"]="published-reference"},{["containerItemID"]=20602,["instructions"]="Published Abyssal Scepters #8364: minimum 60, Both factions. Bring Bor Wildmane three Abyssal Scepters20515 for one Chest of Spoils20602. This is an alternative exchange, not three extra scepters for #8352 or a guaranteed gear reward. Current repeat/initial unlocks, reputation, summoning and acceptance remain unverified. See the initial #8352 published itinerary for the first known contact; the exact prerequisite relationship is unresolved.",[