ng the Note drops; current unlock and drop conditions remain unverified. This is a starting item, not a free quest-provided acquisition. No guaranteed NPC farm or guessed floor point.",["starterItems"]={{["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="cc545f990aaaedc03577c945cad4a3888c7d3d34cf1fb3b08189d1a0aff24a09",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=11446"},["itemID"]=11446,["name"]="A Crumpled Up Note"}},["starterZone"]="Blackrock Depths",["starts"]={}},["4282"]={["ends"]={"npc:9023"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8ce_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="c0938520baae74d9469faab1b9996e488a96dfa08bf42b294989f4b781e3e254",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=4282"},["name"]="A Shred of Hope",["objectiveInstructions"]="Recover the two distinct Marshal Windsor's Lost Information items 11464 and 11465 from General Angerforge and Golem Lord Argelmach, and return to Windsor. Exact floor/key/current access remains unverified.",["objectiveZone"]="Blackrock Depths",["objectives"]={"npc:8983","npc:9033"},["questID"]=4282,["relatedQuests"]={4264},["reqlevel"]=50,["requiredItems"]={{["itemID"]=11464,["name"]="Marshal Windsor's Lost Information",["provided"]=false,["quantity"]=1},{["itemID"]=11465,["name"]="Marshal Windsor's Lost Information",["provided"]=false,["quantity"]=1}},["side"]=1,["sourceRequirements"]={"Recover one of each Lost Information item, IDs 11464 and 11465, and return to Windsor. Published references name General Angerforge and Golem Lord Argelmach; the 11464 page also lists Argelmach, so neither exclusivity nor a current drop rate is inferred."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:9023"}},["4286"]={["ends"]={"npc:9177"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8cd_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="ae1eeb8e8a921b92e5749c041c0177d41efb15cb66a5f184d4ecdc680ac5d70c",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=4286"},["itemrewards"]={{11883,1}},["name"]="The Good Stuff",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=4286,["relatedQuests"]={},["reqlevel"]=50,["requiredItems"]={{["itemID"]=11468,["name"]="Dark Iron Fanny Pack",["provided"]=false,["quantity"]=20}},["side"]=1,["sourceRequirements"]={"Collect 20 Dark Iron Fanny Packs in Blackrock Depths and return to Oralius. The fixed reward is one Dingy Fanny Pack, with random contents.","Earlier prerequisites, current quest acceptance and repeatability remain unverified."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:9177"}},["4322"]={["ends"]={"npc:9560"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8cf_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="414c8895296a5a5fdd1a05800a8c8ee02de56c5041a63545759221bfb0417bde",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=4322"},["itemchoices"]={{12061,1},{12062,1}},["itemrewards"]={{12065,1}},["name"]="Jail Break!",["objectiveInstructions"]="Escort Marshal Windsor inside Blackrock Depths, help recover his equipment from the supply area and free his friends; when finished, return to Marshal Maxwell at Morgan's Vigil. Completion is not inferred from merely accepting the escort.",["objectiveZone"]="Blackrock Depths",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=4322,["relatedQuests"]={6402},["reqlevel"]=50,["side"]=1,["sourceRequirements"]={"Escort Marshal Windsor, recover his gear and free his friends, then report to Marshal Maxwell. The published rewards include Ward of the Elements and a weapon choice; this is not the final amulet reward."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:9023"}},["434"]={["ends"]={"npc:482"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8c_publication_evidence.json",["sha256"]="9919174eab355d18fd65eff2fe8a8989e1d0fc41584f662a8af137a895df2224",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=434"},["name"]="The Attack!",["objectives"]={"npc:1754","npc:1755"},["questID"]=434,["relatedQuests"]={394,395,396},["reqlevel"]=16,["side"]=1,["starts"]={"npc:7766"}},["4601"]={["ends"]={"object:175084"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bb_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="3b8b49f9730c357f36113bf015155