erified, so it is not added as another accepted requirement."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:12580"}},["65"]={["ends"]={"npc:266"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint_navigation_evidence.json",["sha256"]="c70b46a5ec74db5631ac4b0466a010579aa3702656e0f09bb3fe56a7ee642f5f",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=65"},["name"]="The Defias Brotherhood",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=65,["relatedQuests"]={132,135,141,142},["reqlevel"]=14,["side"]=1,["starts"]={"npc:234"}},["6501"]={["ends"]={"npc:10929"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="003533ba392f204aef44b5c2ecc2535bbce7e32ba92a17d46267de4d29be9657",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6501"},["name"]="The Dragon's Eye",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=6501,["relatedQuests"]={6403,99435,6502},["reqlevel"]=50,["requiredItems"]={{["itemID"]=16662,["name"]="Fragment of the Dragon's Eye",["provided"]=true,["quantity"]=1,["rawObjectiveProvided"]=true,["startsQuest"]=false}},["side"]=1,["sourceRequirements"]={"Take the provided Fragment of the Dragon's Eye to Haleh in Winterspring. The published guide describes reaching her through Mazthoril cave and a teleport rune. Cave/rune coordinates and current access are not independently verified; no new rune pin is invented."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:1748"}},["6502"]={["ends"]={"npc:10929"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="d1db6db669a0b18b0c63b3576ed92e82b984cb6f5713e22386d31814c2390ba3",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6502"},["itemrewards"]={{16309,1}},["name"]="Drakefire Amulet",["objectives"]={"npc:10363"},["questID"]=6502,["relatedQuests"]={6403,99435,6501},["reqlevel"]=50,["requiredItems"]={{["itemID"]=16663,["name"]="Blood of the Black Dragon Champion",["provided"]=false,["quantity"]=1,["rawObjectiveProvided"]=false,["startsQuest"]=false}},["side"]=1,["sourceRequirements"]={"Obtain one Blood of the Black Dragon Champion from General Drakkisath in Upper Blackrock Spire, then return to Haleh. The quest describes his throne room behind the Halls of Ascension. The blood is a quest input; Drakkisath is not thereby established as a direct dropper of the finished amulet. Alliance quest minimum 50 is a source requirement."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:10929"}},["6561"]={["ends"]={},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint7b_quest_publication_evidence.json",["sha256"]="d8e38fbfdeb7e0153604103c0e98363f109f1c8c43ecb89091c116ea0744f986",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6561/blackfathom-villainy"},["name"]="Blackfathom Villainy",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=6561,["relatedQuests"]={},["starts"]={}},["6566"]={["ends"]={"npc:4949"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="61e5d5e3894712b0f9346f970b7ba281d0d91c041a5f4a8008f89d647f5f4f6a",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6566"},["name"]="What the Wind Carries",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=6566,["relatedQuests"]={6567,6568,6569,6570},["reqlevel"]=55,["side"]=2,["sourceRequirements"]={"Listen to Thrall's account in Orgrimmar."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:4949"}},["6567"]={["ends"]={"npc:10182"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="19e922e0aada6cfc6e552bf29de4b62ab2616163a1d64016aa8e44af7a3c7541",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6567"},["name"]="The Champion of the Horde",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=6567,["relatedQuests"]={6566,6568,6569,6570},["reqlevel"]=55,["side"]=2,["sourceRequirements"]={"Find Rexxar on the paths through Desolace between Stonetalon and Feralas. His published footprints cover a roaming route, not one guaranteed spawn point or an invented midpoint."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:4949"}},["6568"]={["ends"]={"npc:11872"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="c52d2ee75e586ca0fc9b16360f468a9fab7564ae34a9211b9fa5f