 or a new learned crafting recipe."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:11872"}},["6582"]={["ends"]={"npc:10321"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="232480e66f68334cfb946cde26bd0ed93f5097bebabf965444fc92ef4e6a356c",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6582"},["name"]="The Test of Skulls, Scryer",["objectives"]={"npc:10664"},["questID"]=6582,["relatedQuests"]={},["reqlevel"]=55,["requiredItems"]={{["itemID"]=16869,["name"]="The Skull of Scryer",["provided"]=false,["quantity"]=1,["rawObjectiveProvided"]=false,["startsQuest"]=false}},["side"]=3,["sourceRequirements"]={"Obtain Scryer's skull in Winterspring and return to Emberstrife. The guide lists Scryer, Somnus and Chronalis as tasks that can be done in any order; this display is a travel itinerary, not a proven serial prerequisite graph."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:10321"}},["6583"]={["ends"]={"npc:10321"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="7cf65e410eb0d78a7c384033dee704f5d58318acd658fb621b1582655c781478",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6583"},["name"]="The Test of Skulls, Somnus",["objectives"]={"npc:12900"},["questID"]=6583,["relatedQuests"]={},["reqlevel"]=55,["requiredItems"]={{["itemID"]=16870,["name"]="The Skull of Somnus",["provided"]=false,["quantity"]=1,["rawObjectiveProvided"]=false,["startsQuest"]=false}},["side"]=3,["sourceRequirements"]={"Obtain Somnus's skull in Swamp of Sorrows and return to Emberstrife. The full skull quest publishes Side Both; the Horde final reward does not overwrite that per-quest fact."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:10321"}},["6584"]={["ends"]={"npc:10321"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="084036fc7ed6bae0353c56666c7a22f84932e95ba848ceb0d1480ecaed6ebc38",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6584"},["name"]="The Test of Skulls, Chronalis",["objectives"]={"npc:8197"},["questID"]=6584,["relatedQuests"]={},["reqlevel"]=55,["requiredItems"]={{["itemID"]=16871,["name"]="The Skull of Chronalis",["provided"]=false,["quantity"]=1,["rawObjectiveProvided"]=false,["startsQuest"]=false}},["side"]=3,["sourceRequirements"]={"Obtain Chronalis's skull near the Caverns of Time in Tanaris and return to Emberstrife. Keep the published area rather than a fabricated precise point."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:10321"}},["6585"]={["ends"]={"npc:10321"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="4993aca1ae1d313a76d2db148810b65706680fce752742250972e284446b906e",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6585"},["name"]="The Test of Skulls, Axtroz",["objectives"]={"npc:12899"},["questID"]=6585,["relatedQuests"]={6601,6602},["reqlevel"]=55,["requiredItems"]={{["itemID"]=16872,["name"]="The Skull of Axtroz",["provided"]=false,["quantity"]=1,["rawObjectiveProvided"]=false,["startsQuest"]=false}},["side"]=3,["sourceRequirements"]={"Obtain Axtroz's skull near Grim Batol in Wetlands and return to Emberstrife. Earlier skull-task unlock requirements and current acceptance remain unverified."},["sourceRequirementsUnresolved"]=true,["starts"]={"npc:10321"}},["6601"]={["ends"]={"npc:10182"},["evidence"]={["file"]="checkpoint8bs_working_evidence.json",["sha256"]="117cc766f17ad8a9bef0b352da11872b19c02e7ec3796a29eadb714610fbf8b2",["url"]="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6601"},["name"]="Ascension...",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=6601,["relatedQuests"]={6585,6602},["reqlevel"]=55,["requiredItems"]={{["itemID"]=16888,["name"]="Dull Drakefire Amulet",["provided"]=true,["quantity"]=1,["rawObjectiveProvided"]=true,["startsQuest"]=false}},["side"]=2,["sourceRequirements"]={"Take the provided Dull Drakefire Amulet to Rexxar. This quest item is distinct from both the disguise amulet and the final equipment; do not substitute its binding, slot or requirements for the finished item."},["sourceRequirem